1
00:00:00,214 --> 00:00:04,914
(Sheldon:)What? In the Chattahoochee
National Forest in Georgia?

2
00:00:04,919 --> 00:00:09,889
(Sheldon:)I can't be the only one
that knows that's halfway.

3
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:12,100
(Beverley:)You're not seriously going
to visit each other.

4
00:00:12,122 --> 00:00:13,142
(Alfred:)And why wouldn't we?

5
00:00:13,167 --> 00:00:15,227
(Beverley:)Oh please, you're just saying
this to antagonize me.

6
00:00:15,524 --> 00:00:18,344
(Alfred:)Oh, not at all. Mary happens
to be a wonderful woman.

7
00:00:18,349 --> 00:00:20,649
(Alfred:)And if it antagonizes you,
that's just a bonus.

8
00:00:22,853 --> 00:00:25,073
(Leonard:)Mary, I'm sorry you're
in the middle of this.

9
00:00:25,072 --> 00:00:27,102
(Mary:)No, no, nothing to be
sorry about.

10
00:00:27,107 --> 00:00:29,357
(Mary:)I genuinely like your father.

11
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:32,110
(Sheldon:)What? But he's a
mediocre academic.

12
00:00:32,112 --> 00:00:35,702
And according to Beverly,
his sexual prowess is subpar.

13
00:00:36,834 --> 00:00:40,114
(Sheldon:)He's basically Leonard
with a bigger prostate.

14
00:00:42,506 --> 00:00:45,726
(Leonard:)Are you saying that my dad's
not good enough for your mom?

15
00:00:45,726 --> 00:00:48,046
(Sheldon:)Yes, while also getting in
a solid dig at you.

16
00:00:48,045 --> 00:00:49,625
(Sheldon:)Pretty efficient, huh?

17
00:00:50,881 --> 00:00:53,711
(Leonard:)This is ridiculous.
I-I'm going across the hall.

18
00:00:53,717 --> 00:00:55,637
(Sheldon:)But why should you get to go
and leave me here

19
00:00:55,636 --> 00:00:56,636
(Sheldon:)with your bickering parents?

20
00:00:56,637 --> 00:00:57,887
Fine, then you go!

21
00:00:57,888 --> 00:01:00,018
(Mary:)Well, I don't want to stay
here with her. I'll go.

